          "pali": "Navamaṃ."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sn27.10",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:0.1",
          "pali": "Saṃyutta Nikāya 27.10"
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:0.2",
          "pali": "1. Kilesavagga"
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:0.3",
          "pali": "Khandhasutta"
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:1.1",
          "pali": "Sāvatthinidānaṃ."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:1.2",
          "pali": "“Yo, bhikkhave, rūpasmiṃ chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso …pe… yo viññāṇasmiṃ chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:1.3",
          "pali": "Yato kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno imesu pañcasu ṭhānesu cetaso upakkileso pahīno hoti, nekkhammaninnañcassa cittaṃ hoti."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:1.4",
          "pali": "Nekkhammaparibhāvitaṃ cittaṃ kammaniyaṃ khāyati, abhiññā sacchikaraṇīyesu dhammesū”ti."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:1.5",
          "pali": "Dasamaṃ."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:1.6",
          "pali": "Kilesavaggo paṭhamo."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:2.0",
          "pali": "Tassuddānaṃ"
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:2.1",
          "pali": "Cakkhu rūpañca viññāṇaṃ,"
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:2.2",
          "pali": "phasso ca vedanāya ca;"
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:2.3",
          "pali": "Saññā ca cetanā taṇhā,"
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:2.4",
          "pali": "dhātu khandhena te dasāti."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn27.10:2.5",
          "pali": "Kilesasaṃyuttaṃ samattaṃ."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}